{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heartwarming farm simulation game &quot;Meows Farm&quot; crops turn into cats! Sow seeds, water them, play with them every day, and watch the cat sprouts thrive. Harvest adorable cats, discover and collect rare breeds. Through careful training, make them even more unique, and build your cat manor!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/496910adc98837eba961305cee27243b.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/496910adc98837eba961305cee27243b.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/496910adc98837eba961305cee27243b.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoe the land, water and fertilize. But on top of that, remember to play with the cats\u2014don't forget you're growing cats!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e Keep Your Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/abf6755842cd48a0b24e5f32090301c5.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/abf6755842cd48a0b24e5f32090301c5.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/abf6755842cd48a0b24e5f32090301c5.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting doesn't mean the end. After training at the Cat School they become better cats (and more valuable)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e Upgrade Your Manor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to upgrade your manor: larger farmland, more decorations, and a bigger cat school!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e Play Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items and play with your cats through mini-games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e And More...</h2><p class=\"