530010/extras/abf6755842cd48a0b24e5f32090301c5.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting doesn't mean the end. After training at the Cat School they become better cats (and more valuable)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e Upgrade Your Manor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/1f43bb4e28384267efc877d981629258.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to upgrade your manor: larger farmland, more decorations, and a bigger cat school!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc3e Play Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.poster.avif?t=1759509147\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.webm?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530010/extras/e2487bd1b23fd5dde81e9ed28765000e.mp4?t=1759509147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items and play with your cats through mini-games!</p><h2 class=\"b